msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn about the [primitive base classes](/guides/primitives) that the IBM Quantum primitives are based on.\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples), or [Executor](/guides/executor-examples) examples.\n"
"- See the input and output details for [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output), and [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- See the [EstimatorV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [SamplerV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2), and [Executor API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"คำแนะนำ\">\n"
"- เรียนรู้เกี่ยวกับ [Qiskit primitives](/guides/primitives) ที่ Qiskit Runtime primitives อ้างอิง\n"
"- ทบทวนตัวอย่างโดยละเอียดของ [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples), หรือ [Executor](/guides/executor-examples)\n"
"- ดูรายละเอียด input และ output สำหรับ [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output), และ [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output)\n"
"- ฝึกใช้ primitives โดยทำ [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) ใน IBM Quantum Learning\n"
"- ดู [EstimatorV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [SamplerV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2), และ [Executor API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor)\n"
"- อ่าน [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
